cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Mertensiella caucasica GIS Habitat Suitability - Data Preparation Workflow
message: If you use this workflow, please cite the associated article.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yildirim
    given-names: Ridvan
    email: ridvan.yildirim@omu.edu.tr
    affiliation: Ondokuz Mayis University
repository-code: https://github.com/reyildirim/Semender_Habitat_Suitability
abstract: >-
  Open-source geospatial data-preparation workflow for the multi-criteria
  habitat suitability assessment of the Caucasian salamander (Mertensiella
  caucasica sensu lato) across its transboundary range in north-eastern Turkiye
  and Georgia.
keywords:
  - habitat suitability
  - Analytic Hierarchy Process
  - GIS
  - amphibian conservation
  - Mertensiella caucasica
  - Caucasus
